  "idea": "Beginner guide to bookmark managers that save tabs across all devices",
  "text": "This clean tool saves all your open tabs into one organized collection in one click. Hoarding tabs because you might read them later drains your battery and slows down your computer. Traditional bookmarks become an unsearchable graveyard where saved links are easily forgotten. Add OneTab to collapse dozens of open tabs into a clean, searchable list in one second. You speed up your machine effortlessly.",
